    "detailed_description": "&quot;The first story of the inevitable bloodbath between the Demon Society and Earth God Entertainment!&quot;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750890/extras/88d909b7630825c418e643c3ae14438e.poster.avif?t=1705368141\" width=616 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750890/extras/88d909b7630825c418e643c3ae14438e.webm?t=1705368141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750890/extras/88d909b7630825c418e643c3ae14438e.mp4?t=1705368141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25a0 Game Introduction \u25a0<br>- This is a 2D side-scrolling flight shooter.<br>- You must progress to the final boss with the lives you are given.<br><br>\u25a0 Worldview description \u25a0<br>- The world depicts the conflict between the demonic Demon Society, whose ambition is to conquer the human world, and the earthly god Entertainment, who seeks to defend the human world for the sake of justice.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750890/extras/07cb2135d18d213f6216b950d80a8e31.poster.avif?t=1705368141\" width=616 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750890/extras/07cb2135d18d213f6216b950d80a8e31.webm?t=1705368141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750890/extras/07cb2135d18d213f6216b950d80a8e31.mp4?t=1705368141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25a0 Characters \u25a0<br>- Deoksoon<br>&quot;Shall we...possess? ...like this?&quot;<br>- Hong Seohwa<br>&quot;Do you know the five virtues?&quot;<br>- WoongJa<br>&quot;That tree looks strong. Is it a god tree? I'll find out.&quot;<br><br>\u25a0 Controls \u25a0<br>- Use the WASD to move your character, and the fire key (J) to fire shots.<br>- Press the skill key (K) to use bombs and charge shots.<br>- Press the booster key (L) to activate boost effects.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750890/extras/09fcd4a1fd3791aeee6ac61aac2ef46e.poster.avif?t=1705368141\" width=616 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750890/extras/09fcd4a1fd3791aeee6ac61aac2ef46e.webm?t=1705368141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750890/extras/09fcd4a1fd3791aeee6ac61aac2ef46e.mp4?t=1705368141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25a0 Game Features \u25a0<br>- Monsters with graphics that reflect Korean tradition (monkfish, shaman, goblin, crow)<br>- You can enjoy the best quality backgrounds.<br>- Differentiated monster patterns that have not been seen in other shooting games to face you.<br><br>\u25a0 Precautions \u25a0<br>- If you quit the game midway through, the score and money you earned will not be saved as data.<br>- The data will be initialized when you uninstall the game.",
